&lt;td colspan="2" rowspan="3" style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;line-height:1pt;font-size:1pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:4pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;ジョブ型人事制度への転換&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:4pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:5pt;font-size:5pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:4pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt; ・「適所適材」の人材配置と処遇&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:4pt;padding-right:2pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt; ・自律的な挑戦に対する機会の提供&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:4pt;padding-right:2pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt; ・専門人材等の積極的な中途採用&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:4pt;padding-right:2pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt; ・タレントマネジメントの強化&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:4.5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:1pt;font-size:1pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
